==========================================================================
  x = 1, z = 1/4  ->  curvature 3x^2-2z-1 = 3/2 (>0)
  w_d = -alpha*d with alpha = 1/2;  predicted third-edge sign flip iff 6*alpha > curvature  ->  6*alpha = 3

   d      R_1<R_2 ?         R_2<R_3 ?      d^2*log(R2/R1)   d^2*log(R3/R2)
